{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:01 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:34 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:34 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"消防員在場救援。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6ff527c657929ea9387c918703ed21d5/2026-10/page_169.jpg\"/><p>今日（22日）早上約8時15分，屯門鳴琴路往良景邨方向、近山景邨景業樓對開發生交通意外，2輛九巴相撞。據報2輛巴士上共有4男5女受傷，包括2名車長，幸全部人輕傷。救援人員趕往現場救援，各傷者由救護車送往屯門醫院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ec83e1073117b0e15450305d9391746/2026-10/1_4_94.jpg\"/><img alt=\"其中一輛九巴的車頭擋風玻璃爆裂。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d5945c4a13f2907159be84fee6578d81/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_30.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f4110bcc1d7f9ad073b41d26541abb5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_29_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員到場救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a9ffac1be3ee55f66bf7106422cd40e5/2026-10/1_4_4.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"車長受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ef7672dab5c69ef4aaf162629881b409/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_30_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"意外中傷者包括兩輛巴士的車長。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5557e8b617e4c44de6d0fd0f0e2b08e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_30_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7c13bd7ba1e604dd67c0f6de9551fe3f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_31.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a8f1c35facca45f234b764b67bdcdf06/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_31_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查事故原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a39a3e2242700894272dbba4981b6954/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/241edd116e82321bf00144884bf60cc9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_32.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ec6922dc0b24dffec489123fe4fd6b10/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_09_39_31_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:52.401521+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:18:17.299441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:55.507790+00:00","content_hash":"4628f675b8aeafbd303b6b4c64726233fb955128a20524fbca6d2b3ae4961f91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}